DELIVERABLE 0 -- THE REAL ARRAY, ITS WEIGHTS AND ITS DISTANCE-PRIOR CATEGORIES
============================================================================================================
  116 pulsars, REAL sky unit vectors (feather pos_t), REAL residual rms (reports/anchor_data_forensics.npz),
  REAL distance priors from get_distance.py vs the Cornell parallax catalogue (CW_transition/anchor_a0_priors.npz).
