============================================================================================================
DELIVERABLE 6 -- CONTROLS: IS THE SUB-PARSEC CERTIFICATION REAL?
============================================================================================================
  A 0.11 pc prior puts a pulsar in a window narrower than one fringe. In that
  regime BOTH the signal contrast and the incoherent-comb null contrast inflate,
  because 'the best rival fringe' is barely represented in the window -- exactly
  the sub-fringe family of artefact this project has already been bitten by. So
  the certification is audited three ways: does the winning fringe contain the
